== write=out
a new file: ok missing
again: err Can't write out/new.txt: file exists.
a file planted: err Can't write out/planted.txt: file exists.
a link planted, to a file out: err Can't write out/to-victim: file exists.
a link planted, to nothing: err Can't write out/to-nothing: file exists.
with sync, a mode and a group: ok missing
its mode: 416
a group alone: ok missing
its mode: 420
private: ok missing
its mode: 384
private, a file there: err Can't write out/key: file exists.
private, read only: ok missing
its mode: 256
new = false, as before: ok missing
out of the folder: permission
exit 0
== write=out/fresh.txt, write=out/to-victim, write=out/to-nothing
the file of the grant: ok missing
again: err Can't write out/fresh.txt: file exists.
a link granted by its name, to a file out: err Can't write out/to-victim: file exists.
a link granted by its name, to nothing: err Can't write out/to-nothing: file exists.
beside the grant: permission
exit 0
